{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Scavenge, Fight, Escape&gt;</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/dde1c899e0107e2ab84522c646fbc676.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/dde1c899e0107e2ab84522c646fbc676.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Midnight Walkers is a hardcore <strong>PvPvE FPS zombie extraction game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>trios mode</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must scavenge for loot to get gear,\u00a0kill zombies and\u00a0other survivors, and escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you successfully escape</strong>,\u00a0<br>you can craft with materials and\u00a0buy/sell more powerful equipment,\u00a0<br>but if you die, you will lose everything you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Liberty Grand Center mega-complex&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/2ad62eb4d9375555534d5aa3c75821d0.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/2ad62eb4d9375555534d5aa3c75821d0.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center, a giant mega-complex in Golden County, <br>has floors\u00a0with different themes and unique loot, including a hospital, a shopping mall, and a casino. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats here are not just zombies or other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the <strong>poison gas system</strong> spreads to random floors, <br>and you must use\u00a0elevators or stairs to avoid it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: <br>every time you move to another floor,\u00a0your chances of encountering\u00a0other survivors will increase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Choose Your Class&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/7399c57e822b810908eff7bd61235f18.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/7399c57e822b810908eff7bd61235f18.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK</strong>, a steadfast warrior armed with a large hammer and heavy armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROW</strong>, an assassin with nimble movements who uses daggers to strike opponents off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCKDOWN</strong>, a sniper who can attack from a distance using a bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARTENDER</strong>, a supporter who can mix cocktails to heal and buff allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the one that fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Face Your Enemies&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e288e67dcd1a82bd9b4e0878821c5481.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e288e67dcd1a82bd9b4e0878821c5481.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies here are all deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the weakest zombie, the <strong>Walker</strong>, can be a great threat if you are surrounded,\u00a0<br>and there are also zombies more lethally mutated than the <strong>Runner</strong>,\u00a0which fiercely pursues survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, the biggest threat is other survivors.<br>Triumph over other survivors, alone or with your teammates, and seize more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best show in Golden County, and the only show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to your performance in The Midnight Walkers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795540?t=1772972631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/2ba19d0b2269f34994d4028df1389a041ee240c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772972631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/851c09ab32b89d9b7a5f5cd97e097e29a23e47b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772972631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/851c09ab32b89d9b7a5f5cd97e097e29a23e47b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772972631","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Next Fest: Most Played DEMO TOP 7</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/fc7d31526b2266e0610b9c1b11d2cb04.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1232 height=308 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Scavenge, Fight, Escape&gt;</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/dde1c899e0107e2ab84522c646fbc676.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/dde1c899e0107e2ab84522c646fbc676.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Midnight Walkers is a hardcore <strong>PvPvE FPS zombie extraction game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>trios mode</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must scavenge for loot to get gear,\u00a0kill zombies and\u00a0other survivors, and escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you successfully escape</strong>,\u00a0<br>you can craft with materials and\u00a0buy/sell more powerful equipment,\u00a0<br>but if you die, you will lose everything you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Liberty Grand Center mega-complex&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/2ad62eb4d9375555534d5aa3c75821d0.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/2ad62eb4d9375555534d5aa3c75821d0.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center, a giant mega-complex in Golden County, <br>has floors\u00a0with different themes and unique loot, including a hospital, a shopping mall, and a casino. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats here are not just zombies or other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the <strong>poison gas system</strong> spreads to random floors, <br>and you must use\u00a0elevators or stairs to avoid it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: <br>every time you move to another floor,\u00a0your chances of encountering\u00a0other survivors will increase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Choose Your Class&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/7399c57e822b810908eff7bd61235f18.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/7399c57e822b810908eff7bd61235f18.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK</strong>, a steadfast warrior armed with a large hammer and heavy armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROW</strong>, an assassin with nimble movements who uses daggers to strike opponents off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCKDOWN</strong>, a sniper who can attack from a distance using a bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARTENDER</strong>, a supporter who can mix cocktails to heal and buff allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the one that fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Face Your Enemies&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e288e67dcd1a82bd9b4e0878821c5481.poster.avif?t=1772972631\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e288e67dcd1a82bd9b4e0878821c5481.webm?t=1772972631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies here are all deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the weakest zombie, the <strong>Walker</strong>, can be a great threat if you are surrounded,\u00a0<br>and there are also zombies more lethally mutated than the <strong>Runner</strong>,\u00a0which fiercely pursues survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, the biggest threat is other survivors.<br>Triumph over other survivors, alone or with your teammates, and seize more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best show in Golden County, and the only show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to your performance in The Midnight Walkers.</p>","developers":["Oneway Ticket Studio"],"dlc":[4013880],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/7e43262aab3706b989139904274c9b464a67e76f/header.jpg?t=1772972631","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"ONEWAY TICKET STUDIO \u00a9 2026. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2795540/48766248/f7d850262a7b8e2dcc368573c04b0e591b610171/1769325946/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769330312","dash_h264":"https://